[h1]TraderX: the trading system for DayZ, successor to TraderPlus[/h1]

TraderX is a complete trading, banking and garage system for DayZ servers. It is the successor to TraderPlus: a full rewrite with a modern interface, safer server-side rules and an easy migration path.

[b]Status: stable.[/b] Fully compatible with DayZ 1.30. It is ready for live servers. As always, test big updates on a test server first.

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Trader[/b]: category sidebar, item tiles or list with buy and sell prices, a cart with totals, favorites, and buying or selling many items at once.
[*][b]Weapon customization[/b]: buy weapons with attachments, variants, server presets and your own saved presets.
[*][b]Vehicles[/b]: buy and sell vehicles with parking spots.
[*][b]Banking[/b]: accounts, ATMs, bank cards, transfers between players, a full ledger, a personal vault, and paying traders from your bank balance.
[*][b]Garage[/b]: park a vehicle and get it back exactly as it was (attachments, cargo, fluids, damage, lock), with 3D preview, servicing, insurance and sharing with other players.
[*][b]CarLock[/b]: 4-digit code locks, lockpicks, and vehicle receipts (pack a vehicle with a wrench, deploy it from the receipt).
[*][b]Safe zones[/b] and [b]licences[/b].
[*][b]Spreadsheet catalog[/b]: new servers get products.csv, categories.csv and presets.csv. Edit them in Excel or Google Sheets. Errors are reported with file and line number.
[/list]

[h1]Requirements[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Community Framework (CF)[/b] only. DabsFramework is no longer needed, and our UI framework (DayZular) is built in.
[*]If your server also loads [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3686232711]DayZular[/url], keep it up to date.
[/list]

[h1]Coming from TraderPlus?[/h1]
TraderX imports a TraderPlus server almost completely: config, traders, stock, licences, bank accounts, vehicles and their CarLock locks, the TraderPlus money players carry, bank cards, and vehicle receipts. Your TraderPlus files are never modified, and a MigrationReport file lists everything that was imported.
Use TraderX [b]instead of[/b] TraderPlus, not next to it. Try the migration on a test server first, then move your live server.
Expansion Market and Dr Jones Trader configs can be imported too.

[h1]Updating from an older TraderX[/h1]
[list]
[*]Back up your profile folder before updating.
[*]Your config, catalog, presets and parked vehicles are kept.
[*]You can remove DabsFramework if no other mod uses it.
[/list]

[h1]Experimental branch[/h1]
Want new builds before everyone else? Use [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3760962576]TraderX Experimental[/url] on a test server.

